'''Miyamoku Musashi''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was introduced in [[Version 5.9 Update|Version 5.9]] and can be unlocked when beating [[Multiversal Studios]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 7.0 Update|Version 7.0]] increases health and damage, grants Zombie Killer, Curse immunity and a chance to freeze [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] enemies.

